msgstr "Konfigurationsordner öffnen"

#. Explanation under the Open Config Folder button in Settings. "mpv.conf"
#. is a filename and "hwdec" an MPV option name; leave both as they are.
#. "Hardware Decoding" is a setting on this screen, so keep it matching
#. that translation.
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/settings/general.py
msgid ""
"Advanced MPV options go in mpv.conf, in this folder. MPV reads it at startup "
"and these settings are applied afterwards, so most of them override it. "
"Hardware Decoding is the exception: set hwdec there and this app leaves it "
"alone."
msgstr ""
"Erweiterte MPV Optionen sind in mpv.conf, in diesem Ordner. MPV liest es "
"beim Starten und diesen Einstellungen werden danach angewendet, die meisten "
"überschreiben es. Hardwaredekodierung ist die Ausnahme: Stelle dort hwdec "
"ein und diese App lässt es wie es ist."

#. Caption under a settings row whose change does nothing until the
#. application is started again.
#: jellyfin_mpv_shim/mpvtk_browser/settings/general.py
msgid "Requires restart"
msgstr "Erfordert Neustart"

